    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "“Gorse Lodge”   Mountainstown Dunleer \r\nOffers a rare opportunity to acquire a stunning detached four bedroom family home, on an attractive site, offering panoramic views of the surrounding countryside. Built in 2009 this stylish B rated family home offers modern spacious and well laid out family accommodation.\r\nLocated in a tranquil setting yet only a short drive from Dunleer village and its many amenities, The property’s location offers convenient access to the M1 motorway\r\n\r\nInternally, “Gorse Lodge” briefly comprises Porch, Entrance Hall, Sitting room with bay windows, dining room with bay window, open plan kitchen and living area with quality kitchen, island unit and 16kw stove in lounge area. A generous utility room with guest Wc, On the first floor the property offers a bright and airy landing master bedroom with dressing room and spacious ensuite, 3 further generous bedrooms and family bathroom. The entire property stands on a picturesque site with gardens to the front, side and rear, patio area, raised area and detached garage. The sale of “Gorse Lodge” offers a discerning purchaser a fabulous family home conveying a sense of space, privacy and charm."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Vestibule - 2.981m x 1.767m \r\nTiled Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall - 6.286m x 3.512m \r\nFeatures Stair Case, Cloak Room \r\n\r\nDining Room - 5.457m x 5.359m \r\nFireplace, Wooden Floor, Bay Window,\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 7.04m x 4.713m \r\nTiled Floor, Bay Window, Fireplace, Sliding Doors to Kitchen and Living Area, Attractively Panelled Walls. \r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Living Area - 11.594m x 5.961m \r\nTiled Floor in kitchen area, Fully Fitted quality kitchen with granite work top, Island Unit, Integrated Oven, Dishwasher, Fridge and Freezer, \nThe living area has wooden floors, and a 16kw stove, Patio Doors to outside Patio area.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 5.662m x 2.243m \r\nFitted Units,  Tiled Floor, Door to side of house. \r\n\r\nGuest Wc - 2.263m x 2.048m \r\nWc, Whb, Panelled Walls, Tiled Floor\r\n\r\nFirst Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 9.527m x 4.282m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.29m x 5.726m \r\n(Master Bedroom) \nBay Window \r\n\r\nDressing Area - 2.42m x 4.57m \r\nFully Shelved\r\n\r\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.486m x 1.483m \r\nFully tiled, Wc, His&Hers Wash hand Basins, Double Shower \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 5.347m x 7.173m \r\nBay Window, Fitted Wardrobes, \r\n\r\nJack & Jill Ensuite - 2.549m x 2.287m \r\nFully tiled, Wc, Whb, Vanity unit and Towel Rail \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 5.285m x 4.29m \r\nFitted Wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 4.908m x 3.715m \r\n\r\n\r\nFamily Bathrooom - 3.79m x 3.758m \r\nWc, Whb, Bath\r\n\r\nOutside - \r\nSpacious and well maintained Garden to Front Side and Rear, Patio area and garage. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
