        "Content": "*Access via electric gates\r\n*Granite Kerbs and Windowsills\r\n*Underfloor Heating downstairs\r\n*Generous and well proportioned living accommodation\r\n*Easy access to Dunleer Village and M1 Motorway\r\n*Oil Fired Central Heating\r\n*Solar Panels\r\n*Well maintained Garden to Front, Rear and Side"
